      "generated_answer": "Nick and his family move to a trailer park because Jerry, Estelle's boyfriend, owes money to a group of sailors and takes them there to escape the situation. The move is intended as a temporary solution to avoid the consequences of Jerry's debts. This relocation brings Nick closer to Sheeni, whom he subsequently romantically pursues. \n\nFinal answer: \\boxed{{Because Jerry owes money to sailors and takes them to escape the situation.}}",
