    "prediction": "claude-3-haiku-20240307",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "The correct answer is \\boxed{D}. Reconstruction was a period following the Civil War that was intended to reintegrate the Southern states into the Union and provide for the rights of freed slaves, but these promises were largely unfulfilled, leading to the need for the desegregation of schools in the Brown v. Board of Education decision.",
      "success": true,
